      "content": "idk, it just feels like i'm just stuck in this loop where the harder i run, the more exhausted i get, and nothing actually moves. it's like i'm just waiting for something to finally break because i can't do this for another ten years. it feels totally impossible to fix. it's almost like the only way to actually make the pressure go away is to just... stop. like, just end the noise entirely. does that sound crazy?",
